        "id": 2600712586,
        "content": "I think it might make sense to limit rewards up to the task amount. This should be configurable with a boolean. \r\nIf its a 6 USD task, and a team member gets 100 USD for writing a spec, feels a bit unfair for the contributor who implemented the fix. \r\nAlso i think this can incentivize team members to focus more on saving their time. \r\nDont spin your wheels on tiny tasks.\r\nhttps://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/issues/339#issuecomment-2420930764",
